'''Muscle Empire''' (マッスルエンパイア ''Massuru Enpaia'', '''Muscle Empire''') is the 29th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 127th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Another somewhat simple sub-chapter aside from the introduction of [[Le'Prude]], who can be an extremely difficult boss to counter. Their inclusion makes [[Synthol Swamp]] and [[Side Chest Isle]] moderately difficult, but the rest of the sub-chapter is fairly easy to compensate for this.

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Le'Prude]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Le'boin]] that attacks over twice as frequently, moves slightly faster and is immune to freeze. Only stands at 250 range, but has an Omni Strike that pierces up to 400 and guaranteed [[Explosion]]s that further extend Le'Prude's reach to 675.

