==Trivia==
*The names of Muscle Empire's stages reference various terms related to [[wikipedia:Bodybuilding|bodybuilding]], the controlled process of developing muscles. [[Physique Mystique]], [[Boulder Shoulder]], and [[Side Chest Isle]] relate to the muscles of the entire body, of the shoulders/deltoids, and of the obliques respectively, while the others reference certain compounds/processes used to build those muscles:
**[[The Bulking Grounds]] refers to the process of maintaining a calorie surplus, often resulting in gaining fat that can be converted into more muscle.
**[[Whey Wasteland]]: [[wikipedia:Whey protein|Whey]] is a form of protein very commonly found in protein powders and drinks used to provide raw material to build muscle during bodybuilding.
**[[Synthol Swamp]] names a type of [[wikipedia:Site enhancement oil|site enhancement oil]], which unlike the previous two stages, does not describe a muscle building technique, but rather a method of appearing that those techniques have been used. These oils are injected into the skin to alter the shape and size of the muscle, but obviously, this does not actually build muscle definition. The changes are only skin-deep, similarly to how [[Le'Prude]] was only visually changed by a recolor.

